  "defaultInitPrompt": {
    "zh": "我要把一个小想法做成能收款的生意。请按 GSD 五相环拆解，给我 30 天任务卡、依赖波次和验收标准，标出需要我签字的事项。",
    "en": "I want to turn a small idea into a business that can actually collect payments. Run the GSD five-phase loop, hand me 30-day task cards, dependency waves and acceptance criteria, and flag everything that needs my signature."
  },
