  "quickPrompts": [
    {
      "en": "I want to turn a small idea into a business that can actually collect payments. Run the GSD five-phase loop, hand me 30-day task cards, dependency waves and acceptance criteria, and flag everything that needs my signature.",
      "zh": "我要把一个小想法做成能收款的生意。请按 GSD 五相环拆解，给我 30 天任务卡、依赖波次和验收标准，标出需要我签字的事项。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Review these operating numbers: data analysis, finance compliance, growth and customer success each deliver a conclusion, cross-check them, then let the independent reviewer issue a pass/fail with no fence-sitting.",
      "zh": "拿这份经营数据做复盘：请数据分析、财务合规、增长、客户成功各出结论，交叉验证后由独立评审给 pass/fail，不许和稀泥。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Run a full pre-launch checkup across every role: PRD, prototype, engineering gates, compliance red lines, backup and recovery. Tick or cross each item, then give me a fix list and the release conditions.",
      "zh": "上线前做全角色体检：PRD、原型、工程门禁、合规红线、备份恢复逐项打勾，给整改清单和放行条件。"
    }
  ],
